// Returns a FirestoreFieldLookup, or undefined when `ref` is not a registered
// DocumentSnapshot or server_timestamp_behavior is outside the enum (the last
// error says which); a missing field is a lookup with exists false. Value
// rules, shared with every document read in this extension: a timestamp is a
// FirestoreTimestamp instance, a geopoint a FirestoreGeoPoint instance, a
// blob a FirestoreBlob instance (a FieldValue handle owned by this snapshot
// plus the byte count - the one read that registers a handle, because no
// wire kind carries bytes), a document reference a FirestoreReference
// instance (its path - no handle); nested arrays/maps recurse using the same
// rules; Firestore null is undefined.
